<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-RESULT IN THE SPANISH CUP SEMIFINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULT IN THE SPANISH CUP SEMIFINAL.</headline>
<dateline>VIGO, Spain 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the Spanish Cup semifinal second leg on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    Celta Vigo    1   Real Betis     1</p>
<p>(Betis won 2-1 on aggregate and qualified for the final)</p>
</text>
